id trade-corridor
title Settle a trade corridor treaty
lang treaty
audience banks, trade finance, cooperatives, central banks
safety settlement
summary Three trading partners net what they owe each other and settle once, with the 0.08889% assurance fee, on a scratch engine.
step settle treaty corridor.treaty
draft corridor.treaty Write a ZXV treaty for the trade described by the user. Keep every party's claim at or below its deposit and make the weights add up to exactly 1.
